WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You don't need a life-changing promise
to try a small habit.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Scientists can study surprising experiences.
That doesn't prove a product will create a benefit.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Zen12 is sold as a twelve-minute meditation audio program,
with twelve levels and four audio styles per level.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Format is a reason to look closer.
It's not proof of the seller's mental-performance claims.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try a free twelve-minute observation first.
Find out whether the routine suits your day.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the independent guide and limitations.
The offer link stays closed until authorization is verified.
